PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Back-and-forth trades of Chillet/Elphidran Aqua/Pengullet/Fuack for most of the game (roughly even material trades turns 1-16). FahmiG built Reptyro (8 Souls) but it self-damaged own board via Pump-Action Shotgun (1200 to own Pals) then got destroyed by Scale's counter-attacks. Turns 17-18: Scale's Reptyro-equivalent and Chillet hit FahmiG for 3+2 (8 to 5 to 3). Turn 19 FahmiG played Strike from the Darkness (destroying own Reptyro?), deployed Celaray, chipped Scale for 1 (8 to 7). Turn 20 Scale's Chillet hit FahmiG twice more (3 to 1, one cancelled by Lucky Pal), deployed 2x Foxparks (one interrupted by Cryolinx). Turn 21 FahmiG played Aurora Guide/Victor's Strategy, deployed Chillet, then surrendered at 1 life vs Scale's 7.


